try"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c45" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#B42318;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#B42318;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c12" target="c13"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c46" value="③" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#B42318;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#B42318;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.62;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c10" target="c21"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c47" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#5B8DB8;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#5B8DB8;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c22" target="c23"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c48" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#5B8DB8;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#5B8DB8;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c23" target="c24"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c49" value="④" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#B54708;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#B54708;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c24" target="c35"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c50" value="⑤" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#B54708;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#B54708;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c14" target="c11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c51" value="&lt;b&gt;Reading path&lt;/b&gt;   ①  The 28 V bus enters input conditioning.   ②  The conditioned bus feeds the pre-regulator.   ③  The pre-regulator output feeds the four rail regulators.   ④  Each rail reports power-good to the sequencer through its window monitor and current limit.   ⑤  Current sense closes the peak-current-mode inner loop.   ·   dashed boxes are off-chip   ·   pre-silicon architecture; values are design targets" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1E293B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="790" width="1480" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c52" value="Designed toward (targets, not certificates): DO-160 sections 16 and 17, MIL-STD-704F, MIL-STD-1275D, MIL-STD-461G, MIL-STD-883 Class B" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#6B7280;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="860" width="1480" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
